---
layout: layouts/base.njk
locale: en
title: "Check RECA Eligibility | Downwinders Advocates"
description: "Check your family's eligibility for federal Radiation Exposure Compensation Act (RECA) programs. Covered counties, qualifying conditions, and claim filing support."
permalink: /check/
extraScripts: '<script src="/js/screener.js" defer></script>'
---
<section class="sec" id="check">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">
      <p class="eyebrow">Quick &amp; Confidential Eligibility Check</p>
      <h1>See If Your Family Qualifies For Federal Compensation</h1>
      <p class="lede">Answer a few questions for an initial guide to the relevant programs. This check stays in your browser; our team does not receive it.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Ready to File Callout -->
    <div class="callout-box" style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;width:100%">
      <strong>Already know you qualify?</strong>
      <p>If you are ready to start a claim, you can request a call with a specialist below. The questions on this page are an informational preview and do not submit a claim.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Screener & Intake Form -->
    <div class="form-card" style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;width:100%">
      <h2 style="font-size:24px;color:var(--navy)">Initial Eligibility Guide</h2>
      <p class="muted">No name, phone number, or email is needed for this private preview. To have a specialist review your case, request a callback after the result.</p>
      <form id="screener" class="stack">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="place">Where did the affected family member live or work?</label>
          <select id="place" name="place" required>
            <option value="">Select an answer</option>
            <option value="state">Utah, New Mexico, or Idaho: Lived anywhere in the state</option>
            <option value="az">Arizona: Coconino, Yavapai, Navajo, Apache, Gila, or Mohave County</option>
            <option value="nv">Nevada: Eureka, Lander, Lincoln, Nye, White Pine, or designated Clark County</option>
            <option value="uranium">Uranium Industry: Mined, milled, or transported uranium ore</option>
            <option value="onsite">On-Site Participant: Present at atmospheric nuclear tests or test sites</option>
            <option value="mpw">Manhattan Project Waste: Qualifying communities in MO, TN, KY, or AK</option>
            <option value="dunno">I am not sure of the exact county / need help checking</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="years">Estimated timeframe of residency or employment:</label>
          <select id="years" name="years" required>
            <option value="">Select an answer</option>
            <option value="ok">At least one year between January 1951 and November 1962</option>
            <option value="oknm">New Mexico: At least one year between September 1944 and November 1962</option>
            <option value="okjuly">Present for the entire month of July 1962</option>
            <option value="uranium">Uranium employment between 1942 and 1971</option>
            <option value="dunno">I am not sure of the exact dates</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="who">Who is filing this claim?</label>
          <select id="who" name="who" required>
            <option value="">Select an answer</option>
            <option value="self">The person who was exposed (filing for myself)</option>
            <option value="survivor">Surviving family member: Spouse, child, grandchild, or parent of deceased</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" type="submit" style="align-self:flex-start;font-size:18px;padding:16px 36px">See Initial Guidance &rarr;</button>
        <div class="result" id="out" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <!-- Clean 3-Column / 3-Bullet List of Covered Cancers & Conditions (No Dropdowns) -->
    <div class="cancers-overview" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp4) auto 0;width:100%">
      <div class="cancers-overview-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Medical Eligibility Criteria</span>
        <h2>Covered Conditions by Program</h2>
        <p class="muted">RECA explicitly covers specific primary cancers and chronic respiratory/renal conditions established by federal law:</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cancers-cols">
        <!-- Col 1: Downwinders -->
        <div class="cancer-col-card">
          <h4>Downwinders (19 Primary Cancers)</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Leukemia (non-chronic lymphocytic)</li>
            <li>Multiple Myeloma</li>
            <li>Lymphomas (other than Hodgkin's)</li>
            <li>Thyroid &amp; Female/Male Breast</li>
            <li>Lung, Colon &amp; Stomach</li>
            <li>Pancreas &amp; Liver (non-cirrhotic)</li>
            <li>Brain &amp; Salivary Gland</li>
            <li>Urinary Bladder &amp; Kidney</li>
            <li>Ovary &amp; Esophagus</li>
            <li>Pharynx, Small Intestine, Bile Ducts &amp; Gall Bladder</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Col 2: Uranium Workers -->
        <div class="cancer-col-card">
          <h4>Uranium Workers (7 Conditions)</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Primary Lung Cancer</li>
            <li>Pulmonary Fibrosis</li>
            <li>Cor Pulmonale (related to fibrosis)</li>
            <li>Silicosis</li>
            <li>Pneumoconiosis</li>
            <li>Renal (Kidney) Cancer</li>
            <li>Chronic Renal Disease (including nephritis and tubal tissue injury)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Col 3: Manhattan Project Waste -->
        <div class="cancer-col-card">
          <h4>Manhattan Waste &amp; On-Site</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Bone Cancer &amp; Renal Cancer</li>
            <li>Leukemia &amp; Lymphomas</li>
            <li>Primary Thyroid &amp; Breast Cancer</li>
            <li>GI Tract &amp; Respiratory Cancers</li>
            <li>On-Site Atmospheric Exposure Conditions</li>
            <li>Reimbursement of Related Medical Expenses</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Explanation while the team prepares a video -->
    <div class="form-card" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp4) auto 0;width:100%">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why we ask</p>
      <h2>Why We Need Your Information</h2>
      <p>Your answers help our team identify the relevant program and explain what records may be needed. You do not need to have every date or document ready to get started.</p>
      <p class="muted">A specialist can help you work through questions about location, dates, and medical history. <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a> if you would rather talk first.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-card" id="request-callback" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp4) auto 0;width:100%">
      <h2>Ready to Talk with a Specialist?</h2>
      <p class="muted">Use the secure callback form below to send your name and phone number to our team. We can discuss the next steps together.</p>
      {% include "partials/lawmatics-callback.njk" %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
